Slash Proficiency represents your training with edged cutting weapons such
as swords, axes, scimitars, and similar armaments. These weapons deal
damage through sweeping cuts that slice through flesh and armor.

Higher proficiency increases your accuracy and effectiveness with slashing
weapons. As you advance, you learn proper edge alignment, footwork, and
cutting angles that allow you to land devastating wounds more consistently.

Slashing weapons excel against lightly armored or unarmored foes, where
their cutting edges can inflict grievous wounds. They require regular
maintenance with the "sharpen" skill to maintain their edge.

Once you have achieved sufficient proficiency in slashing weapons, you may
pursue Slash Specialization for additional attacks per round.

